factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  reel_script says the 30 students are from Salem, Namakkal and Dharmapuri districts, but the article says 30 students from these three districts filed the complaint while the 7,500 figure refers to people across those districts; the script's attribution of 30 students is fine, but slides_spec 'புகார் யார்?' correctly lists 30 — no issue there, so the real problem is that reel_script says the bank informed 7,500 people 'இதேபோல் கடன் பெற்றுள்ளதாக' which matches, however the caption says 'கல்லூரி மாணவர்களின்' while the article's 7,500 refers to a different group than the 30 complainants (minor framing)
  caption says the bank informed the 7,500 people took loans 'இதேபோல்' (in the same way), which the article attributes to the bank saying 7,500 people in these districts took loans for cow purchase; this is a close paraphrase but the caption presents it as a fact about bank statements rather than the complainants' claim
  reel_script omits that the complaint was filed by 30 students and the bank's statement that the loan was for buying a cow is partly stated; more importantly the reel_script omits that the article reports the complaint was given to Salem city police commissioner's office and the police are investigating — this is included, so no omission there
  caption says 'ஓர் அரசு வக்கீல் துணையாக இருப்பதாக' — the article says a government lawyer is helping the fraudsters per the complaint, which matches; however the reel_script wording 'மோசடியில் ஒரு அரசு வக்கீல் துணையாக இருப்பதாக' is acceptable
  slides_spec slide 'எப்படி ஏமாற்றினர்?' says the students were told the bank account would receive Rs.1 lakh, but the article says the 1 lakh would come to the students' bank accounts and they were to transfer it to the account given; the slide line 'வங்கிக் கணக்கில் ரூ.1 லட்சம் வரும் என்றனர்' is accurate, but the slide omits that students transferred money and received commission, a material step of the fraud
  caption adds a safety advice line 'ஆதார் விவரங்களை யாரிடமும் பகிர வேண்டாம்; கடன் நோட்டீஸ் வந்தால் உடனே வங்கியில் விசாரியுங்கள்' which is not in the article (invented advice)
  caption English footer 'Students' Aadhaar misused for Rs 75 crore loan fraud | Namakkal news' is a footer and therefore not counted
